#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:5
#: 20be38a29d274aa9be99b198759dff17
msgid "SITL setup on Windows using Cygwin (not recommended)"
msgstr "在 Windows 上使用 Cygwin 设置 SITL（不推荐）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:9
#: 883adfe8ba364251b2d83138dc530ed7
msgid ""
"These instructions are out-of-date.  We recommend Windows users follow the "
"instructions for :ref:`Setting up the Build Environment using WSL <building-"
"setup-windows>` and :ref:`Setting up SITL on WSL <sitl-on-windows-wsl>`"
msgstr ""
"这些说明已过时。我们建议 Windows 用户按照 :ref:`使用 WSL 设置构建环境 <building-setup-windows>` 和 "
":ref:`在 WSL 上设置 SITL <sitl-on-windows-wsl>` 中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:11
#: b21194e62e9842aea5b5f2b61ec6e001
msgid ""
"SITL was originally developed on Linux, but can also be built and run "
"*natively* on Windows. It can also be run on a virtual machine (Linux) "
"hosted on Windows, Mac OSX, or Linux or by using the Windows Subsystem for "
"Linux (WSL)."
msgstr ""
"SITL 最初在 Linux 上开发，但也可以在 Windows 上*原生*构建和运行。也可以在 Windows、Mac OSX 或 Linux "
"上托管的虚拟机（Linux）中运行，或使用适用于 Linux 的 Windows 子系统（WSL）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:13
#: 359329d28b1b410fa136d4f6cfaf4718
msgid ""
"Currently, the simplest way to run SITL on Windows is to build the code and "
"simulate using WSL: in Windows 10 :ref:`building-setup-windows10_new`"
msgstr ""
"目前，在 Windows 上运行 SITL 最简单的方式是使用 WSL 构建代码并仿真：在 Windows 10 上参见 :ref:`building-"
"setup-windows10_new`。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:15
#: 3620ad325da44c00ab4a82a2766dc715
msgid ""
"Prerequisites: 'Windows 10 64bit'  at a minimum, this will not work on , for"
" example, Windows 7. It also will not run on any 32bit windows installation."
msgstr ""
"前提条件：至少需要「Windows 10 64 位」，不适用于 Windows 7 等系统，也无法在任何 32 位 Windows 安装上运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:17
#: ccdd970b6b8d46bdaf5ad6d76d93bdaa
msgid ""
"The remainder of this article shows how to build and run :ref:`SITL "
"(Software In The Loop) <sitl-simulator-software-in-the-loop>` *natively* on "
"Windows using Cygwin. These commands were tested on Windows 10 with "
":ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>` and Copter-4.0.0-dev."
msgstr ""
"本文其余部分介绍如何在 Windows 上使用 Cygwin *原生*构建和运行 :ref:`SITL（软件在环）<sitl-simulator-"
"software-in-the-loop>`。这些命令已在 Windows 10 上配合 :ref:`MAVProxy <mavproxy:home>`"
" 和 Copter-4.0.0-dev 测试通过。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:23
#: ee19901708e040bc899152dfd501a5f7
msgid "MAVProxy Map: Guiding a SimulatedCopter"
msgstr "MAVProxy 地图：引导仿真多旋翼飞行器"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:26
#: 03db0e3e61f84826a2b458098305459f
msgid "Installation steps"
msgstr "安装步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:28
#: 10089075e3b54311bee55957f7f78891
msgid ""
"Install Cygwin as described :ref:`here <building-setup-windows-cygwin>`"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`此处 <building-setup-windows-cygwin>` 的说明安装 Cygwin。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:29
#: c175837e1eca40fc8dd86c6565ce5fba
msgid ""
"`Download MAVProxy for Windows "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/MAVProxySetup-latest.exe>`__ "
"(latest build), install the executable including accepting the license and "
"all default installation options"
msgstr ""
"`下载 Windows 版 MAVProxy "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/MAVProxySetup-"
"latest.exe>`__（最新版本），安装可执行文件，接受许可协议和所有默认安装选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:33
#: ff5f19571e3748a9a08f6a48f80b6ab3
msgid ""
"Make sure that Cygwin is in your PATH. As for troubleshooting, you may add a"
" Windows environment variable called CYGWIN_HOME in your path pointing to "
"your c:\\cygwin\\bin (if you installed at \"C:\"). You may check it by doing"
" a Right-click on \"My Computer\" -> Properties -> Advanced -> Environment "
"Variables. In Windows Terminal using PowerShell use the command ``bash`` to "
"access cygwin from PowerShell."
msgstr ""
"确保 Cygwin 已添加到 PATH 中。如需排查问题，可在路径中添加名为 CYGWIN_HOME 的 Windows 环境变量，指向 "
"c:\\cygwin\\bin（如果安装在「C:」）。可以右键点击「我的电脑」-> 属性 -> 高级 -> 环境变量进行检查。在 Windows "
"Terminal 使用 PowerShell 时，使用 ``bash`` 命令从 PowerShell 访问 Cygwin。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:36
#: e4321c87e11242dfb5c1042c52164139
msgid "Running SITL"
msgstr "运行 SITL"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:38
#: 50b01a5b183f48ce938f1fa8db29cdfb
msgid "Open a Cygwin64 terminal from the start menu"
msgstr "从开始菜单打开 Cygwin64 终端。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:40
#: 3551785f137b4180be1fc8110d71a598
msgid ""
"Navigate to one of the vehicle directories (in this case Copter) and call "
"``sim_vehicle.py`` to start SITL.  If you get a windows security alert for "
"the firewall, allow the connection."
msgstr ""
"导航到某个飞行器目录（此处为 Copter），然后调用 ``sim_vehicle.py`` 启动 SITL。如果出现防火墙的 Windows "
"安全提示，请允许连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:47
#: fb8a976151ac40b5b674090223b598af
msgid "SITL and *MAVProxy* will start. *MAVProxy* displays three windows:"
msgstr "SITL 和 *MAVProxy* 将启动。*MAVProxy* 显示三个窗口："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:49
#: 7170ec16bf6143fe994be393bfb00831
msgid "A command prompt in which you enter commands to SITL"
msgstr "一个命令提示符，用于向 SITL 输入命令"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:50
#: 737951e6a8ae447c91e7f19e31c9b386
msgid "A Console which displays current status and messages"
msgstr "一个显示当前状态和消息的控制台"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:51
#: 0042b045a7bb443dbe7618cc372401a0
msgid ""
"A map that shows the current position of the vehicle and can be used (via "
"right-click) to control vehicle movement and missions."
msgstr "一张显示飞行器当前位置的地图，可通过右键点击控制飞行器移动和任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:60
#: 37284bbe6bd247c88fec6b214d3c8a12
msgid ""
"It is useful to arrange the windows as shown above, so you can observe the "
"status and send commands at the same time."
msgstr "建议按上图所示排列窗口，以便同时观察状态和发送命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:63
#: 540a2d2a406d41fc85fa42d2a18784fb
msgid ""
"Send commands to SITL from the command prompt and observe the results on the"
" map."
msgstr "从命令提示符向 SITL 发送命令，并在地图上观察结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:65
#: d40dce777b8e43418a3cd58c49aa74ea
msgid "Change to GUIDED mode, arm the throttle, and then takeoff:"
msgstr "切换到 GUIDED 模式，解锁油门，然后起飞："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:73
#: b8bbd92de9904ad6b51242c53259f5bb
msgid "Watch the altitude increase on the console."
msgstr "在控制台上观察高度的增加。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:77
#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:228
#: 295401ba8f2c4d61aa90b157935fdf6f eecddd41a37a471c92591b377ec2274b
msgid ""
"Takeoff must start within 15 seconds of arming, or the motors will disarm."
msgstr "起飞必须在解锁后 15 秒内开始，否则电机将上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:80
#: 43d6613ed5804587b83853e6331aed3c
msgid "Change to CIRCLE mode and set the radius to 2000cm"
msgstr "切换到 CIRCLE 模式并将半径设置为 2000 厘米。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:88
#: a0e92121ea09428cae4462273d16c0e7
msgid "Watch the copter circle on the map."
msgstr "在地图上观察多旋翼飞行器绕圈飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:90
#: 9ade38fe1ba14241b3cf0be078060c06
msgid "When you're ready to land you can set the mode to RTL (or LAND):"
msgstr "准备降落时，可以将模式设置为 RTL（或 LAND）："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:96
#: 4663de16a27742f7a3e88df65f6210f4
msgid ""
"This is a very basic example. For links to more information on what you can "
"do with SITL and MAVProxy see the section: :ref:`Next Steps <sitl-native-on-"
"windows_next_steps>`."
msgstr ""
"这是一个非常基础的示例。有关 SITL 和 MAVProxy 更多功能的链接，请参阅 :ref:`后续步骤 <sitl-native-on-"
"windows_next_steps>` 章节。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:101
#: 63dc29011e6a49638b1701d220b64446
msgid ""
"Use batch files to simplify the running of SITL down to a single double-"
"click. See `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/autotest/win_sitl>`__"
" for some examples."
msgstr ""
"使用批处理文件将 SITL 的运行简化为单次双击。参见 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/Tools/autotest/win_sitl>`__"
" 的一些示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:104
#: 75272ea78433486fb324e4518af5c3eb
msgid "FlightGear 3D View (Optional)"
msgstr "FlightGear 三维视图（可选）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:106
#: ccad39fd7339491c9fd32425515a1ba6
msgid ""
"`FlightGear Flight Simulator <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ can also be "
"used as a viewer to display a 3D simulation of the vehicle and its "
"surroundings. This provides a much better visualization than the 2D maps and"
" HUD flight displays provided by *MAVProxy* and *Mission Planner*."
msgstr ""
"`FlightGear 飞行仿真器 <http://www.flightgear.org/>`__ "
"也可用作查看器，以三维方式显示飞行器及其周围环境的仿真。这比 *MAVProxy* 和 *Mission Planner* 提供的二维地图和 HUD "
"飞行显示提供了更好的可视化效果。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:115
#: 14883176a9794615861679847ad295fd
msgid "FlightGear:Simulated Copter at KSFO (click for larger view)."
msgstr "FlightGear：在 KSFO 仿真的多旋翼飞行器（点击查看大图）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:117
#: bda0ccd30ee341cc86885f28b1e78b7c
msgid ""
"SITL outputs *FlightGear* compatible state information on UDP port 5503. We "
"highly recommend you start *FlightGear* before starting SITL (although this "
"is not a requirement, it has been found to improve stability in some "
"systems)."
msgstr ""
"SITL 通过 UDP 端口 5503 输出与 *FlightGear* 兼容的状态信息。我们强烈建议在启动 SITL 之前先启动 "
"*FlightGear*（虽然这不是必需的，但在某些系统上已发现这样做能提高稳定性）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:122
#: c2de97dc02a34f5d807831c0e3d7361f
msgid "The main steps are:"
msgstr "主要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:124
#: 8f8bd79085434b5c985444f6a655f415
msgid "Download `FlightGear 3.4.0 <http://www.flightgear.org/download/>`__"
msgstr "下载 `FlightGear 3.4.0 <http://www.flightgear.org/download/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:128
#: d79a333891384337a3fb13011f598b70
msgid "At time"
msgstr "撰写本文时"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:129
#: f99cb484b3f145c6a418ebec846596d9
msgid ""
"of writing `version 3.4.0 is required on Windows "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/3422>`__."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上 `需要 3.4.0 版本 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/3422>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:131
#: 13580b1fcb2c490aa6969ee58fb0af85
msgid ""
"Open a new command prompt and run the appropriate batch file for your "
"vehicle in **/ardupilot/Tools/autotest/**: `fg_plane_view.bat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_plane_view.bat>`__"
" (Plane) and `fg_quad_view.bat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_quad_view.bat>`__"
" (Copter)."
msgstr ""
"打开新的命令提示符，在 **/ardupilot/Tools/autotest/** "
"中运行适合您飞行器的批处理文件：`fg_plane_view.bat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_plane_view.bat>`__（固定翼）和"
" `fg_quad_view.bat "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Tools/autotest/fg_quad_view.bat>`__（多旋翼）。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:138
#: f1d5b9283d3446cea6af676786a7310c
msgid "This will start FlightGear."
msgstr "这将启动 FlightGear。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:139
#: 738d205dc5af4a50bc30f77944fc329e
msgid ""
"Start SITL in Cygwin in the normal way. In this case we're specifying the "
"start location as San Francisco airport (KSFO) as this is an interesting "
"airport with lots to see:"
msgstr "在 Cygwin 中以正常方式启动 SITL。此处我们将起始位置指定为旧金山机场（KSFO），这是一个有很多可看内容的有趣机场："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:150
#: f72b91e6fd4a48858595d84755efe73a
msgid "*FlightGear* will always initially start by loading scenery at"
msgstr "*FlightGear* 启动时总是先加载"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:150
#: 89416bb83ee74a0683aca49acb939699
msgid ""
"KSFO (this is hard-coded into the batch file) but will switch to the scenery"
" for the simulated location once SITL is started."
msgstr "KSFO 的场景（这在批处理文件中是硬编码的），但一旦 SITL 启动，将切换到仿真位置的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:156
#: 40e7377ee09e419094bba13992fe4076
msgid "If the vehicle appear to be hovering in space (no"
msgstr "如果飞行器看起来悬浮在空中（没有"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:156
#: d675df5a6b2f460783407d6470c388f4
msgid ""
"scenery) then *FlightGear* does not have any scenery files for the selected "
"location. Choose a new location!"
msgstr "地景），则 *FlightGear* 没有所选位置的场景文件。请选择一个新位置！"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:159
#: 39dc3130ff67410482b13c23d4f2d35b
msgid ""
"You can now takeoff and fly the vehicle as normal for :ref:`Copter <copter-"
"sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` or :ref:`Plane <plane-sitlmavproxy-tutorial>`, "
"observing the vehicle movement including pitch, yaw and roll."
msgstr ""
"您现在可以按照 :ref:`Copter <copter-sitl-mavproxy-tutorial>` 或 :ref:`Plane <plane-"
"sitlmavproxy-tutorial>` 的正常方式起飞并飞行，观察飞行器的运动，包括俯仰、偏航和横滚。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:167
#: ba7e27e5202645949309a303c40ef0a6
msgid "Connecting with another GCS"
msgstr "连接其他地面控制站"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:169
#: ffaf5ea0ebdf4d789b378135f47320e9
msgid ""
"You can attach multiple additional ground control stations to SITL from "
"*MAVProxy*. The simulated vehicle can then be controlled and viewed through "
"any attached GCS."
msgstr "您可以从 *MAVProxy* 将多个额外的地面控制站连接到 SITL。仿真飞行器随后可通过任何连接的地面控制站进行控制和查看。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:173
#: d5e4142aee4e4236ad66e8407f6738e7
msgid ""
"First use the ``output`` command on the *MAVProxy command prompt* to "
"determine where *MAVProxy* is sending packets:"
msgstr "首先在 *MAVProxy 命令提示符* 中使用 ``output`` 命令查看 *MAVProxy* 正在向哪里发送数据包："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:183
#: d50c982097874fc1b0cd505ec9358076
msgid ""
"This tells us that we can connect *Mission Planner* to either UDP port 14550"
" or 14551, as shown on the dialog below."
msgstr "这告诉我们可以将 *Mission Planner* 连接到 UDP 端口 14550 或 14551，如下图对话框所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:189
#: 18c5072b63164f4e9a6a14a54d3f38d3
msgid "Mission Planner: Connecting to a UDPPort"
msgstr "Mission Planner：连接到 UDP 端口"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:193
#: d64c5413babf43119116d586974029ba
msgid ""
"We could connect *APM Planner 2* to the remaining port. If we needed a third"
" port, we could add it as shown:"
msgstr "我们可以将 *APM Planner 2* 连接到剩余的端口。如果需要第三个端口，可以如下添加："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:200
#: 73da8519bbd84261ace717d5a97afe87
msgid ""
"*Mission Planner* can then be used to control the simulated vehicle in "
"exactly the same way as though it were a real vehicle. We can reproduce the "
"previous \"takeoff-circle-land\" example as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* 随后可以完全按照操控真实飞行器的方式控制仿真飞行器。我们可以重现之前的「起飞-绕圈-降落」示例，如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:204
#: 187ac86991e045fba3719f6d2bd76cdc
msgid "Change to GUIDED mode, arm the throttle, and then takeoff"
msgstr "切换到 GUIDED 模式，解锁油门，然后起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:206
#: 8a4c93616cad439a867865367922fe54
msgid ""
"Open the *FLIGHT DATA* screen and select the *Actions* tab on the bottom "
"left. This is where we can change the mode and set commands."
msgstr "打开 *FLIGHT DATA* 界面，选择左下角的 *Actions* 选项卡。这里可以更改模式和设置命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:213
#: 8fde7beeeb2545079669f101f338a62b
msgid "Mission Planner: Actions Tab (Set Mode, Arm/Disarm)"
msgstr "Mission Planner：Actions 选项卡（设置模式、解锁/上锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:215
#: 96fa8c236e1f4713984423f04a619df0
msgid ""
"Select **Guided** in the *Mode selection list* and then press the **Set "
"Mode** button."
msgstr "在*模式选择列表*中选择 **Guided**，然后按 **Set Mode** 按钮。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:217
#: e8fce251d6af411d8c7f360a42713d77
msgid "Select the **Arm/Disarm** button"
msgstr "选择 **Arm/Disarm** 按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:218
#: bdaa1e478ed9451f9516bc92e202e457
msgid ""
"Right-click on the map and select Takeoff. Then enter the desired takeoff "
"altitude"
msgstr "在地图上右键点击并选择「起飞」，然后输入所需的起飞高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:224
#: e445983fa0c444d5aa3f38594d8f94b2
msgid "Mission Planner Map: Takeoff Command"
msgstr "Mission Planner 地图：起飞命令"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:231
#: ef4371375f2440b2b5a10123b95ff1f2
msgid ""
"Change to CIRCLE mode on the *Action* tab and watch the copter circle on the"
" map."
msgstr "在 *Action* 选项卡中切换到 CIRCLE 模式，在地图上观察多旋翼飞行器绕圈飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/sitl-native-on-windows.rst:233
#: e88364520fd9441da17857041a29e22b
msgid ""
"You can change the circle radius in the *CONFIG/TUNING* screen. Select *Full"
